  "html": "<h2 id=\"1170260916-2026-09-21\"><a href=\"#1170260916-2026-09-21\">1.17.0+260916 (2026-09-21)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features\"><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>helper for java compatible pkcs12 truststores (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/9172e9f3892fef8a507f1e8ef67fa1978e26a3e5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">9172e9f</a>)</li>\n<li>deployment prefixed file name for the client certificate (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/adbae9db5597292c954564d45e7c4ac6beab4492\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">adbae9d</a>)</li>\n<li>deployment prefixed name for the client CA bundle (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/48723e28c5abaa74f51f453216fd1a2e9904733b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">48723e2</a>)</li>\n<li>make the Let's Encrypt chain path configurable (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/a0e1fcd4b99211228e25dd13ce48f1869a8cf926\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">a0e1fcd</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"fixes\"><a href=\"#fixes\">Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>ship the CA bundle as a java truststore so ATAK sees the anchors (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/6b9b4c4526da83ca7d15aaa7a9c3d40abeff2317\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">6b9b4c4</a>)</li>\n<li>bind CA and client certificates to the ATAK cot_streams connection (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/f4f4f696edaa54e5e1d222a5945ad8d634547080\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">f4f4f69</a>)</li>\n<li>correct atakPluginScanningOnStartup preference key spelling (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/2a78e5dbe29c6b2d496ad7867a29e1431c150123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2a78e5d</a>)</li>\n<li>install certificates before server.pref in missionpkg manifests (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/2c1d4cd45c818d76ae573eca7ac995658e3aa8c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2c1d4cd</a>)</li>\n<li>prefix the client certificate with deployment name in missionpkg templates (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/70fd2bb9420b8b934ba2c3b3a37e494444aee483\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">70fd2bb</a>)</li>\n<li>write the client p12 under the name the manifest asks for (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/c165e2fdfe8c7180ecf4c87200e3000ba00bdb47\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c165e2f</a>)</li>\n<li>prefix the CA bundle with deployment name in missionpkg templates (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/ab3f4891190b5c325552fc770ea79cb6eacf0c37\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ab3f489</a>)</li>\n<li>write the CA bundle under the name the manifest asks for (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/8f5f55b7383992deab69a6710876d2ea7b20c7c0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8f5f55b</a>)</li>\n<li>ship Let's Encrypt roots in the TAK client trust bundle (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/f5b62c4e7f28e8951938ccd724ab9c7d9a810e4f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">f5b62c4</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-changes\"><a href=\"#other-changes\">Other changes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>document the java compatible CA truststore (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/6e9635a152e90c706f0cf501d900c6c7953de774\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">6e9635a</a>)</li>\n<li>cover the java truststore serialization (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/019403f26d06c84e2645bd52ba2fc2ef7f0dfb00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">019403f</a>)</li>\n<li>require cryptography>=45.0.1 for java truststore support (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/d8a495797abc8016952e5f404ac092a47af7942c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d8a4957</a>)</li>\n<li>document the ATAK connection specific certificate entries (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/475db115f1c031a661c2358c07c7096273414422\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">475db11</a>)</li>\n<li>cover connection specific certificate preferences (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/d33cbf2e8cd5703da45ed9120f32d20eab7d1ccc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d33cbf2</a>)</li>\n<li>document the missionpkg manifest ordering requirement (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/e46ac6131ca86058a021035a9c312212497910a0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">e46ac61</a>)</li>\n<li>cover missionpkg manifest ordering and naming (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/688cfe466b1eb50a69dff85f1b3d39df4a94bf5c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">688cfe4</a>)</li>\n<li>document the client certificate file naming (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/4eaad22d2340b1bc905718db68d2f15b5e095036\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">4eaad22</a>)</li>\n<li>cover the deployment prefixed client certificate name (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/f8d27c9d051ac9efaf1aea3efe6fbc4a559f630c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">f8d27c9</a>)</li>\n<li>document TI_TAK_CA_CERT_NAME (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/ceb70de7a12386d7cdbbcea75f9f2fac0012b49f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ceb70de</a>)</li>\n<li>cover the deployment prefixed CA bundle name (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/ac44858f0f6b799f89411a3772078027c9213a22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ac44858</a>)</li>\n<li>document the TAK client trust bundle sources (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/b5c53fbedf3362e1411a555465c23318d2c2d771\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">b5c53fb</a>)</li>\n<li>expect public trust anchors in the client bundle (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/6f0b7cb683874ee51634be39be5d9bbe10cffef2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">6f0b7cb</a>)</li>\n<li>restore ISRG Root X1 trust anchor template (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/86bfc0d313dc7306bc3d29e37cbe0e88130a579e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">86bfc0d</a>)</li>\n</ul>"
}
